      "content": "it's not just a transition though. it doesn't feel like i'm \"changing.\" it feels like the software was uninstalled. there's nothing left to support or transition into. i've spent my whole life building that version of me and now it's just... deleted. how can you even talk about a \"future\" for someone who isn't even there anymore?",
