    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a platitude. \"rebuilding\" implies there's still something worth saving. if the core of who i was is gone, then this body is just... it's just a leftover. a ghost following a dead account. it feels so pointless to keep performing this life when the version of me that mattered has been wiped out. like, what's even the point of staying when the person everyone actually cared about doesn't exist anymore?",
